Package: endogCopulaBayes
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Gaussian Copula Endogeneity Correction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Ashwin", family = "Malshe", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ashwin@malshe.com")
Description: Implements the Bayesian Gaussian copula endogeneity correction of
    Haschka (2022b) <https://ssrn.com/abstract=4235194> via a
    Metropolis-within-Gibbs sampler, ported from the original EndogCopula
    research scripts. The sampler jointly estimates the regression
    coefficients, the residual variance, the copula correlation matrix, and
    Dirichlet probability masses describing the marginal distributions of the
    regressors, and returns the full MCMC chain alongside a thinned posterior
    sample with print and summary methods.
